        <img
          src="/media/arkitera/homepage-full.webp"
          alt="The redesigned Arkitera homepage, full length: hero project and latest items, competition calendar, new projects, news and events, opinion and interviews, jobs and products, the advertising band and the footer"
          width="1600"
          height="6446"
